msgid ""
"Image(s) used in Cluster Layouts must either exist in destination "
"cloud/resource or be able to be copied to destination by Morpheus, "
"typically applicable for non-public clouds. For the initial provision, "
"Morpheus System Images are streamed from Cloud Front through Morpheus to "
"target destination. Subsequent provisions clone the local Image."
