msgstr "**GROUP:** Un previamente creado |morpheus| Grupo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes.rst:504
msgid "**CLOUD:** A previously-integrated Cloud"
msgstr "**CLOUD:** Un previamente-integrated Nube"

